D3 event lab (V0.3). The D3 World Packages are built from photogrammetry
models published on Sketchfab under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
International license (CC-BY-4.0,
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/), modified by metric scaling,
levelling, registration and derived layers:

- "oryahovo - crop #1 - metashape texture problems" by Mitko
  (https://sketchfab.com/bg3d),
  https://sketchfab.com/3d-models/oryahovo-crop-1-metashape-texture-problems-979b09bd0b7744989d5786c2635f24ba
- "An entire small town scanned by a drone" by Mitko
  (https://sketchfab.com/bg3d),
  https://sketchfab.com/3d-models/an-entire-small-town-scanned-by-a-drone-ebdd505832c745e081f03d8e29d17f84
- "Anciolina: 3D Hilltop Village Scan, Snowy" by Dok11
  (https://sketchfab.com/dok11),
  https://sketchfab.com/3d-models/anciolina-3d-hilltop-village-scan-snowy-64ede430838142f5929edfc7eb371efc

The source models and the World Packages built from them are not in this
repository. Registration evidence, anchors and road graphs are derived from
OpenStreetMap data, (c) OpenStreetMap contributors, available under the Open
Database License (ODbL-1.0, https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/);
layers derived from it are labelled separately. Elevation data: SRTM terrain
data courtesy of the U.S. Geological Survey; Europe terrain data produced
using Copernicus data and information funded by the European Union - EU-DEM
layers (Terrain Tiles on AWS).

